    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63196947d315ce42bf17f4b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠的有力竞争者在经典级选择参加『宝\r\n冢纪念』，的确相当少见。要问为什么的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a77bdd409054b0ca389c6be80b78c49ab218fcf04965f0a235ba4a2c466a8caf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105309.json",
